  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.0:\n\t\t\t- Lightweight object-to-object mapping with minimal configuration\n\t\t\t- Type mapping with automatic property matching\n\t\t\t- Custom property mappings and transformations\n\t\t\t- Support for mapping profiles to organize configurations\n\t\t\t- Custom type converters for complex transformations\n\t\t\t- Extension methods for fluent mapping syntax\n\t\t\t- Collection mapping support (List, Array, IEnumerable)\n\t\t\t- Optimized performance with compiled expressions\n\t\t\t- Comprehensive error handling with specific exceptions\n\t\t\t- Full .NET Standard 2.0 compatibility",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "Knot - Object-to-Object Mapper for .NET",
